      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Al-shaykh Ab\u016b l-\u1e6c\u0101[hir the government agent charged with the sale of]</li>\n<li>flax&mdash;one d[inar].</li>\n<li>Barak\u0101t b. \u02bfAmm\u0101r&mdash;the rest of</li>\n<li>one dinar.</li>\n<li>Barak\u0101t b. \u1e6cayyib&mdash;</li>\n<li>one dinar.</li>\n<li>Baq\u0101 the perfumer&mdash;one half.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b l-Mun\u0101 the government official&mdash;</li>\n<li>one dinar.</li>\n<li>Mak\u0101rim, Baq\u0101&rsquo;s partner&mdash;</li>\n<li>one dinar.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b l-Fa\u1e0dl the government official&mdash;</li>\n<li>one dinar.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br b. Nu\u1e63ayr&mdash;</li>\n<li>two dinars.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Sahl b. Ayy\u016bb&mdash;one half.</li>\n<li>The &lsquo;delight&rsquo;&mdash;one half and one quarter.</li>\n<li>S\u0101lim the seller&mdash;one half.</li>\n<li>Hiba the dyer and his children&mdash;one half.</li></ol>\n",
